  "description": "A fast, dependency-light pivot table engine for .NET. Build pivot results from objects, dictionaries, DataTables, JSON, and CSV with grouping, aggregation, filtering, sorting, show-as calculations, drill-down, pagination, cancellation, and Excel export.",
